# Root config

- Values and pure functions only. No React, no `fetch`, no clients.
- `VITE_*` is public. Never put payment or private keys here.
- Timeouts/paths: `api-client.ts`. Registry: `remotes.ts`. Flags: `features.ts`. Dist: `mfe-local-dist.ts`.
- `createApiClient` stays in `modules/api`. Modules read constants from `@/config`.
